<title>UK: TMCC prices 1.0 bln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC prices 1.0 bln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and SBC Warburg, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    08.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.812   PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.562    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/HK/LON/SING</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.25 PERCENT SEPTEMBER 2001 BUND</p>
